#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv)(III) percentage and number of participants in an education or training program intended to lead to a credential or employment` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv)(III) percentage and number of participants in an education or training program intended to lead to a credential or employment`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv)(IV) measures developed by each State agency to assess skills acquisition` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv)(IV) measures developed by each State agency to assess skills acquisition`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv)(V) other indicators approved by the Secretary` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv)(V) other indicators approved by the Secretary`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv) any other measure` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(B)(iv) any other measure`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv)(I) a report for each fiscal year of the numbers who meet the conditions, are offered a position, and participate` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv)(I) a report for each fiscal year of the numbers who meet the conditions, are offered a position, and participate`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv)(II) a description of the programs the State agency uses and their availability` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv)(II) a description of the programs the State agency uses and their availability`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv)(III) any additional information the Secretary determines appropriate` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv)(III) any additional information the Secretary determines appropriate`
#ASSERT `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv) any other information` EQUALS `s 2025(h)(5)(C)(iv) any other information`
